.TH "NETPLAN\-STATUS" "8" "" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
\f[CR]netplan\-status\f[R] \- query networking state of the running
system
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-debug\f[R]] \f[B]status\f[R]
\f[B]\-h\f[R]|\f[B]\-\-help\f[R]
.PP
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R] [\f[I]\-\-debug\f[R]] \f[B]status\f[R]
[\f[I]interface\f[R]]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan status [interface]\f[B]\f[R] queries the current
network configuration and displays it in human\-readable format.
.PP
You can specify \f[CR]interface\f[R] to display the status of a specific
interface.
.PP
Currently, \f[B]\f[CB]netplan status\f[B]\f[R] depends on
\f[CR]systemd\-networkd\f[R] as a source of data and will try to start
it if it\[aq]s not masked.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\f[CR]\-h\f[R], \f[CR]\-\-help\f[R]
Print basic help.
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-debug\f[R]
Print debugging output during the process.
.TP
\f[CR]\-a\f[R], \f[CR]\-\-all\f[R]
Show all interface data including inactive.
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-diff\f[R]
Analyse and display differences between the current system configuration
and network definitions present in the YAML files.
The configuration analysed includes IP addresses, routes, MAC addresses,
DNS addresses, search domains and missing network interfaces.
.RS
.PP
The output format is similar to popular diff tools, such \f[CR]diff\f[R]
and \f[CR]git diff\f[R].
Configuration present only in the system (and therefore missing in the
Netplan YAML) will be displayed with a \f[CR]+\f[R] sign and will be
highlighted in green.
Configuration present only in Netplan (and therefore missing in the
system) will be displayed with a \f[CR]\-\f[R] sign and highlighted in
red.
The same is applied to network interfaces.
.RE
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-diff\-only\f[R]
Same as \f[CR]\-\-diff\f[R] but omits all the information that is not a
difference.
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-root\-dir\f[R]
Read YAML files from this root instead of \f[CR]/\f[R].
.TP
\f[CR]\-\-verbose\f[R]
Show extra information.
.TP
\f[CR]\-f\f[R] \f[I]\f[CI]FORMAT\f[I]\f[R], \f[CR]\-\-format\f[R] \f[I]\f[CI]FORMAT\f[I]\f[R]
Output in machine\-readable \f[CR]json\f[R] or \f[CR]yaml\f[R] format.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\f[B]\f[R](5), \f[B]\f[CB]netplan\-get\f[B]\f[R](8),
\f[B]\f[CB]netplan\-ip\f[B]\f[R](8)
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
